# Generated host projections — mechanical copies of agents/ and skills/, regenerated by
# scripts/generate_platform_adapters.py and gated byte-for-byte. They are excluded from ripgrep so
# a search over this repo returns each hit ONCE, from the canonical source that you can actually
# edit. Without this, every skill string matches three times and the canonical copy is not the one
# that sorts first.
#
# This file governs `rg` only. Git still tracks these paths, the byte gate still checks them, and
# the validators read them through pathlib — none of that is affected.
#
# To search them on purpose (debugging the generator, confirming a host difference):
#   rg --no-ignore <pattern> plugins/save-toolkit/skills/
#
# To fix something you found in one: edit the canonical file under agents/ or skills/, then run
#   python scripts/generate_platform_adapters.py --write
# Editing a projection directly is erased by the next regeneration.
.github/agents/
.codex/agents/
platforms/copilot/skills/
plugins/save-toolkit/skills/
